@format 1
@id preview.seek
@title Seek preview
@area Preview
@entry input
@summary The preview and timeline cursor converge on the requested position.
@flow TB
@related preview.open-media
@tag playback
@tag seek

@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer

[input] Seek preview request <input>
- Receive the active workspace command @ viewer.PViewerSeek(...)
> guard

[guard] Check preview readiness <decision>
- Confirm that viewer commands are enabled and a player exists @ viewer.PViewerSeek(...)
? "Preview is ready" > apply
? "Preview is unavailable" > unchanged

[apply] Apply playback state <process>
- Request an accurate Flyleaf seek and publish the requested position @ viewer.PViewerSeek(...)
> result

[result] Playback synchronized <output>
=The preview and timeline cursor converge on the requested position.

[unchanged] No change <output>
= Playback state is unchanged.
